to the main scene, the progress \"Updating scene\" appears and after that the first right click displays and context menu of the scene tab. My guess is that `get_tree()->get_root()->set_input_as_handled();` causes the focus out of the scene tab from being triggered.\r\nI tested on Godot master without this PR and I'm not able to reproduce.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/292faf80-2f17-45b4-9da5-901ba3fee13e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2580522384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2581282945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2581282945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2581282945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z20CB","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T21:30:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T21:30:16Z","body":"No idea what causes it. Hiding the dialog and removing all input/processing overrides does not fix the issue. It's like it's caused by the existence of the dialog alone.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2581282945/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2581532205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2581532205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2581532205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z3w4t","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T01:01:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T01:01:50Z","body":"The issue is caused because `Viewport::_gui_input_event` does not process the button release and `gui.mouse_focus` is never reset to null.\r\nI'm not sure why, but when I comment the line `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->process_events();`  in `ProgressDialog::_update_ui` is issue is fixed. Is that line still needed? I'm not sure but this line seems to drop events.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2581532205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582630160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2582630160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2582630160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z788Q","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T12:44:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T12:44:43Z","body":"It's part of the code that manually processes SceneTree. It's probably supposed to keep the dialog responsive and allow to cancel during processing.\r\n...Except it doesn't work. I don't know what changed, but #93481 stays unresolved (it was being fixed in my previous tests).\r\n\r\nI'll just remove this line.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582630160/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582988589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2582988589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2582988589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z9Uct","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T15:40:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T15:40:44Z","body":"Nice, it fixes the issue. I'll continue working in Godot using this PR to see if I spot other side effects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582988589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588478089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2588478089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2588478089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aSQqJ","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T23:59:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T23:59:31Z","body":"Unfortunately, the last modification brings a \"semi-bad\" side effect. The editor window is unresponsive while the progress dialog is displayed. I retested after readding the `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->process_events();` and the editor is responsive with the line.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92baaaa3-ef6e-42fc-9e78-7628aa52fd0c)\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588478089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588488971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2588488971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2588488971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aSTUL","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T00:21:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T00:21:58Z","body":"Ok, I found a workaround... The issue is that `gui.mouse_focus` is still set in the `ViewPort`. I saw that there's a private method: `Viewport::_drop_mouse_focus()` that resets it.\r\nAnd `Viewport::_drop_mouse_focus()` is called in `set_disable_input`.\r\n\r\nSo adding these lines in `ProgressDialog::_popup` fixes the issue of the right click after the save of a used scene and changing to the main scene:\r\n```cpp\r\n...\r\nreparent(current_window);\r\n\r\nbool window_is_input_disabled = current_window->is_input_disabled();\r\ncurrent_window->set_disable_input(!window_is_input_disabled);\r\ncurrent_window->set_disable_input(window_is_input_disabled);\r\n\r\nshow();\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that there's probably a more elegant way to fix the issue but it works.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588488971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589634614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99844#issuecomment-2589634614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99844","id":2589634614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aWrA2","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T11:09:40Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T11:09:40Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589634614/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]